# Build outputs: the publishable packages copy the root `templates/` and
# `registry/` next to their `dist/` so npm can ship them. They are regenerated by
# `pnpm run build` before packing, so tracking them only duplicates every diff and
# lets the copies drift out of date.
packages/cli/templates/
packages/cli/registry/
packages/registry/registry/

# OpenCraft skills install receipt (regenerated on every install).
